// Net Cash
// Table: _Measures
// Display folder: Category\02 KPI\Liquidity;Pages\00 Cover;Pages\03 Debt & Net Cash;Pages\04 Notes & Evidence;Pages\05 Financial Statements
// Format: #,##0
// Hidden: false
// Cash & equivalents + current Marketable Securities − Gross Debt (leases excluded). Follows [Marketable Securities] (MarketableSecuritiesCurrent, else DebtSecuritiesCurrent + EquitySecuritiesFvNi). BLANK only if Cash or Marketable Securities is BLANK; use [Net Cash (Cash Only)] when you want to exclude securities.

Net Cash =
VAR _ms = [Marketable Securities]
VAR _debt = [Gross Debt]
RETURN
IF(ISBLANK(_ms) || ISBLANK([Cash]), BLANK(), [Cash] + _ms - COALESCE(_debt, 0))
